{"product_id":"the-one-year-book-of-hope-one-year-books","title":"The One Year Book of Hope (One Year Books)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis book is for anyone who has been hurt in life and would benefit from a hope-filled daily companion. Critically acclaimed author Nancy Guthrie offers insightful daily reflections based on the Word of God to comfort, encourage, and uplift those who are feeling the aches of life--whether it's because of everyday disappointments or deep losses. Through a year's worth of thoughtful entries, the reader will learn how much God longs to lift us up, carry us through in times of difficulty and uncertainty, and give us true, lasting joy. Each daily step draws you closer to a God who truly cares and the hopeful life he wants you to enjoy. In short: Daily Scripture readings. Daily reflections for those who are experiencingany pain, disappointment, or grief. Daily opportunity to \"dig deeper\" into God's Word. Weekly questions for reflection, opportunities forfurther meditation, and directed prayer.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: This book is for anyone who has been hurt in life and would benefit from a hope-filled daily companion. Critically acclaimed author Nancy Guthrie offers insightful daily reflections based on the Word of God to comfort, encourage, and uplift those who are feeling the aches of life--whether it's because of everyday disappointments or deep losses. Through a year's worth of thoughtful entries, the reader will learn how much God longs to lift us up, carry us through in times of difficulty and uncertainty, and give us true, lasting joy. Each daily step draws you closer to a God who truly cares and the hopeful life he wants you to enjoy. In short: Daily Scripture readings. Daily reflections for those who are experiencingany pain, disappointment, or grief. Daily opportunity to \"dig deeper\" into God's Word. Weekly questions for reflection, opportunities forfurther meditation, and directed prayer.\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781414301334\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat:  Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 448\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 150 x 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41750289612953,"sku":"1RB9781414301334","price":30.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-one-year-book-of-hope-one-year-books-498950.jpg?v=1694792794","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-one-year-book-of-hope-one-year-books","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}